const campDesign = 'A Roman castra-inspired fantasy army encampment, empty of people. A complete continuous sharpened timber palisade on a low earth rampart encloses a practical rectangular plan with gently rounded corners. A shallow exterior defensive ditch is crossed only at defended gate causeways. Two principal gravel-and-earth roads intersect near a command tent; secondary lanes separate orderly tent blocks. Show functional tent entrances, ropes and pegs, clear access, drainage, a broad drill ground with training posts at its edge, a supply area with barrels and covered stores, and a water well. Modest timber gate platforms, no monumental castle. Warm cream, weathered ochre and muted red canvas, dark timber, worn natural ground, rich painted surfaces. No army figures, torches, active fires, smoke, flags with text, UI or floating diorama base. Pull the elevated isometric camera back enough to show the WHOLE perimeter, all gates and an apron of surrounding landscape with at least 8 percent margin; no sky or horizon. Keep army scale consistent and routes visibly practical. The regular camp plan contrasts with natural, worn, slightly winding approach roads outside.';
